---

<section
    class="py-40 bg-zinc-900 px-6 border-t border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden"
>
    <div
        class="absolute top-0 right-0 text-[30vw] font-black text-white/5 leading-none pointer-events-none italic select-none"
    >
        RESV
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
        <h2
            class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-black italic tracking-tighter uppercase text-white mb-10 leading-none"
        >
            FAÇA PARTE DA <span class="text-orange-600 line-through"
                >HISTÓRIA.</span>
        </h2>
        <p
            class="text-xl text-zinc-500 font-medium italic mb-16 max-w-xl mx-auto"
        >
            Vagas limitadas para experiência sensorial completa. Reservas
            abertas com 30 dias de antecedência.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <button
                class="py-8 bg-orange-600 text-white font-black italic uppercase text-2xl hover:scale-105 transition-all rounded-[2rem]"
                >RESERVAR AGORA</button
            >
            <button
                class="py-8 border border-white/10 text-white font-black italic uppercase text-2xl hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all rounded-[2rem]"
                >PRIVATE EVENTS</button
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
